    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8158" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circum-dŏlĕo</span></b> ,
			ēre, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to suffer</i>
			
