				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">acc. to Forcellini: circum, seu undique, vel ab
					omni parte angens,</span>”
				i.e. <i>very painful</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Acut. 2, 14, 92</span></i>
			.</div>
